description:
Returns diving certifications from Dive Kit's vetted open dataset of agencies and courses: prerequisites, equivalent courses at other agencies, depth and gas limits, notes and links. Use this when a diver asks what a course allows ("what does PADI Tec 45 let me do"), what they need before a course ("what do I need before a trimix course"), whether two courses are equivalent ("is SSI X equivalent to PADI Y"), or what an agency offers. Not for planning a dive.

This is Dive Kit's own curated data (CC BY 4.0, open.divekit.app), not a web search; agency rules change, so point the diver to the agency for the final word. No engine call.

Example: {"agency":"PADI","query":"tec 45"}
